    "https://www.cbcc.edu.hk/en/schools-and-offices/schools-and-departments/department-of-general-education-and-language-studies/introduction/": {
      "title": "Home",
      "description": "Caritas Bianchi College of Careers Home Eng 繁中 简中 Close Menu Admission Expand Programmes Offered Admission Admission Portal Admission Hotlines Scholarships, Bursaries and Financial Assistance FAQ Programme Registration Programmes Academic Units Expand Irene Lam Department of Design Faith Hope Love Department of General Education SFU Student Expand Student Portal Student Intranet Scholarship Schemes Financial Assistance/ Bursaries Academic Calendar Student Handbook Bad Weather Arrangements Library Language Centre Moodle Staff Expand Staff Portal Email Room Booking System Leave Application eGarden Alumni Expand Alumni Network Media Expand Press Release Media Coverage Latest Updates Recruitment and Outreach Photo Gallery Contact Us Visitor Expand Book a Tour Getting to Campus Campus Map Library Career Expand Senior Management / Deanship / Headship Positions Academic / Teaching Positions Administrative / Services Positions Research / Project Positions Admission Hotlines Student Student Portal Student Intranet Scholarship Schemes Financial Assistance/ Bursaries Academic Calendar Student Handbook Bad Weather Arrangements Library Language Centre Moodle Staff Staff Portal Staff Intranet Email Room Booking System Leave Application eGarden Alumni Alumni Network Media Press Release Media Coverage Latest Updates Recruitment and Outreach Photo Gallery Contact Us Visitor Book a Tour Getting to Campus Campus Map Library Career Senior Management / Deanship / Headship Positions Academic / Teaching Positions Administrative / Services Positions Research / Project Positions Admission Hotlines Eng ENG 繁體 简體 Admission Programmes Offered Admission Admission Portal Admission Hotlines Scholarships, Bursaries and Financial Assistance FAQ Programme Registration Programmes Academic Units Irene Lam Department of Design Faith Hope Love Department of General Education SFU Apply Now Programme Admissions 2023/24 Programme List Apply Now JUPAS E-APP Academic Units Home Academic Units Faith Hope Love Department of General Education Academic Departments Irene Lam Department of Design Faith Hope Love Department of General Education Introduction In September 2009, the Department of General Education and Language Studies was formed through the amalgamation of three bodies: the Language Unit of CBCC, the General Education Unit and the Department of Language Studies under both SFU and CBCC. The Department with its objectives to encompass both Chinese and Western cultures and explore the opportunities of humanism is committed to enhance the students’ proficiency in bi-lingual and tri-literacy so as for them to become intelligent communication practitioners in today’s complex and ever changing society. It, therefore, offers a variety of programmes to cater for the needs of different students at various levels: Diploma of General Studies and Higher Diploma programmes in many disciplines, through which students are able to enhance their professional knowledge, foster their ethics, uphold the sense of service, and strengthen the team leadership spirit, materializing the holistic education at the end. Sub-Menu Introduction Head’s Message Programmes Offered Academic Staff Moodle Site Map Privacy Statement Copyright © 2026 Caritas Bianchi College of Careers. All Rights Reserved."
