    "https://repository.cihe.edu.hk/jspui/": {
      "title": "",
      "description": "Skip to main content Research Outputs Researchers Schools Felizberta Lo Padilla Tong School of Social Sciences Ip Ying To Lee Yu Yee School of Humanities and Languages Rita Tong Liu School of Business and Hospitality Management S.K. Yee School of Health Sciences Yam Pak Charitable Foundation School of Computing and Information Sciences Help SFU Institutional Repository The Institutional Repository is a scholarly research network of SFU, which archives a collection of staff publications that are accessible to all members of SFU. At the moment, the Institutional Repository houses publications that came out from recent years. More and more research papers will be added to the databases on a continuous basis. To update your latest research outputs, please fill out the Collection Form for Staff Publications . Search Loading... Recent Additions Loading... Most viewed Loading... Responsible Use of E‑Resources | Privacy Policy | Disclaimer © SFU Library. All Rights Reserved."
    },
